              <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;">The framework is applied end-to-end, criterion by criterion, on <a href="https://ionova.ai/compare/?utm_source=newsletter" style="color:#0972D3;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;">the comparison pages</a> &mdash; including ioNova vs the SWIFT AI Parser, vs Loqate (GBG), vs Smarty, vs Melissa, and vs GeoPostCodes.</p>

